--------------------- OPTIONS ------------------------------------------
9.80665              g          - Gravitational acceleration (m/s^2) [default: 9.80665]
1025.0               rhoW       - Water density (kg/m^3) [default: 1025]
50.0                 WtrDpth    - Water depth (m) [default: absent standalone; host-owned OpenFAST]
1.0e5                kBot       - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m) [default: 1.0e5]
1.0e4                cBot       - Seabed normal damping base (Pa-s/m) [default: 1.0e4]
0.05                 dtM        - CableDyn internal time step (s) [default: omitted standalone; 0.1 s target OpenFAST]
120.0                TMax       - Standalone simulation duration (s) [default: omitted standalone; host-owned OpenFAST]
30.0                 RangeStart - First output time in the range graphs (s) [default: 0]
data/range_tdp/chain_surge_5m_30s_dt005.txt motionFile - Prescribed fairlead motion history
airy 6.0 10.0 0.0    waves      - Wave model, height, period, and direction (m, s, deg) {none; airy; jonswap} [default: none]
10.0                 rampTime   - Half-cosine start-up ramp of the wave amplitudes (s) [default: 0]
0.4       rhoInf           - Generalised-alpha spectral radius {0<=rhoInf<=1} [default: 0.4]
False     modified_newton  - Tangent-reuse mode {False=full Newton; True=guarded reuse} [default: False]
False     adaptive_mesh    - Automatic finite-EI refinement {False; True} [default: False]
dynamic_solver 1.0e-8 1.0e-14 30 12 - Relative tolerance, absolute tolerance, max iterations, backtracks [defaults shown]
none      frictionMu       - Seabed friction coefficient {none; value>=0} [default: none]
none      current           - Current model and velocity (m/s) {none; uniform; profile} [default: none]
0         WaterKin          - Water-kinematics source {0/none; file; SEASTATE coupled only} [default: no policy]
